This project started as a fork of the Open Knowledge Format (OKF) project by
Google LLC: https://github.com/GoogleCloudPlatform/open-knowledge-format
Copyright 2026 Google LLC. Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The OKF specification, reference agent, viewer, sample bundles and their
tests have been removed. The wiki's on-disk format is derived from OKF v0.2
(see "The wiki on disk" in README.md); src/okf_wiki/document.py reads and
writes it and is an independent implementation.

Files carried over from OKF, modified, and keeping their original headers:
- LICENSE.md: the Apache License 2.0 text, unchanged.
- pyproject.toml: distribution renamed to llm-wiki-v2, the reference agent
  and its Google dependencies removed, okf_wiki package added.
- CONTRIBUTING.md and CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md: contacts and process changed from
  the Google project to this repository.
- .gitignore: entries added.

Everything else (Copyright 2026 Federico Cesarini, Apache-2.0): src/okf_wiki/,
tests/wiki/, docs/wiki/, the Docker stack (Dockerfile, docker-compose.yml,
docker/), .env.example, NOTICE, CITATION.cff.

The Docker stack runs Bifrost (https://github.com/maximhq/bifrost, Apache-2.0)
from its published image; no Bifrost source code is included.
